  "an4.54:0.3": "Living Together (2) ",
  "an4.54:1.1": "“Bhikkhus, there are these four ways of living together. ",
  "an4.54:1.2": "What four? ",
  "an4.54:1.3": "A wretch lives together with a wretch; ",
  "an4.54:1.4": "a wretch lives together with a female deva; ",
  "an4.54:1.5": "a deva lives together with a wretch; ",
  "an4.54:1.6": "a deva lives together with a female deva. ",
